{"id":"vd-a2-the-fake-message","level":"a2","n":11,"title":{"en":"Don't Click That!","vi":"Đừng bấm vào đó!"},"summary":"Ana đang gõ số thẻ ngân hàng của mẹ vào một trang web tặng quà thì anh Leo bước vào — và đọc thấy có gì đó không ổn.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-fake-message","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Fake Message","vi":"Tin nhắn giả mạo"}},"scene":{"background":"home-evening","props":[{"id":"phone","x":800}]},"cast":{"ana":{"name":{"en":"Ana","vi":"Ana"},"look":"teengirl","x":520,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#3A2A22","skin":"#D9A27A","skinShade":"#C48A62","outfit":"tee","top":"#F08FB0","topShade":"#DC7398"}},"leo":{"name":{"en":"Leo","vi":"Leo"},"look":"man","x":1130,"style":{"hair":"fringe","hairColor":"#3A2A22","skin":"#D9A27A","skinShade":"#C48A62","outfit":"jacket","top":"#3A3F4A","topShade":"#2A2F38","scale":0.95},"from":1}},"lines":[{"speaker":"ana","en":"Yes! A new phone! Just a small fee…","vi":"Yeah! Điện thoại mới! Chỉ một khoản phí nhỏ…","ipa":["jɛs","ə","nu","foʊn","dʒʌst","ə","smɔl","fi"],"start":0.554,"end":3.824,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.341],[2,1.409],[3,1.653],[4,2.591],[5,2.89],[6,2.958],[7,3.352]]},{"speaker":"leo","en":"Ana, what are you doing with Mom's card?","vi":"Ana, em làm gì với thẻ của mẹ thế?","ipa":["ˈɑnə","wʌt","ɑɹ","ju","ˈduɪŋ","wɪð","mɑmz","kɑɹd"],"start":4.614,"end":7.154,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,4.614],[1,5.53],[2,5.68],[3,5.748],[4,5.87],[5,6.155],[6,6.332],[7,6.712]]},{"speaker":"ana","en":"I won a prize! Look at this message.","vi":"Em trúng thưởng! Anh xem tin nhắn này này.","ipa":["aɪ","wʌn","ə","pɹaɪz","lʊk","æt","ðɪs","ˈmɛsədʒ"],"start":7.944,"end":10.714,"expression":"happy","gesture":"point","prop":"phone","timing":[[0,7.944],[1,8.008],[2,8.212],[3,8.307],[4,9.421],[5,9.652],[6,9.774],[7,10.032]]},{"speaker":"leo","en":"Stop! Don't type anything!","vi":"Dừng lại! Đừng gõ gì hết!","ipa":["stɑp","doʊnt","taɪp","ˈɛniˌθɪŋ"],"start":11.504,"end":13.594,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,11.504],[1,12.42],[2,12.651],[3,12.991]]},{"speaker":"ana","en":"Why not? It's only two dollars.","vi":"Sao lại không? Có hai đô la thôi mà.","ipa":["waɪ","nɑt","ɪts","ˈoʊnli","tu","ˈdɑlɚz"],"start":14.384,"end":16.734,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,14.384],[1,14.539],[2,15.38],[3,15.556],[4,15.842],[5,16.059]]},{"speaker":"leo","en":"Be careful. This is a scam.","vi":"Cẩn thận đấy. Đây là lừa đảo.","ipa":["bi","ˈkɛɹfəl","ðɪs","ɪz","ə","skæm"],"start":17.524,"end":19.684,"expression":"worried","gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,17.524],[1,17.604],[2,18.678],[3,18.854],[4,18.99],[5,19.072]]},{"speaker":"ana","en":"How do you know?","vi":"Sao anh biết?","ipa":["haʊ","du","ju","noʊ"],"start":20.474,"end":21.244,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,20.474],[1,20.612],[2,20.707],[3,20.857]]},{"speaker":"leo","en":"Look at the address. It's really strange.","vi":"Nhìn địa chỉ đi. Lạ lắm.","ipa":["lʊk","æt","ðə","ˈæˌdɹɛs","ɪts","ˈɹɪli","stɹeɪndʒ"],"start":22.034,"end":24.814,"gesture":"point","prop":"phone","timing":[[0,22.034],[1,22.267],[2,22.417],[3,22.525],[4,23.567],[5,23.771],[6,24.07]]},{"speaker":"leo","en":"And there are mistakes in the English.","vi":"Tiếng Anh lại còn sai nữa.","ipa":["ənd","ðɛɹ","ɑɹ","mɪˈsteɪks","ɪn","ðə","ˈɪŋɡlɪʃ"],"start":25.354,"end":27.484,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,25.354],[1,25.445],[2,25.635],[3,25.785],[4,26.45],[5,26.641],[6,26.722]]},{"speaker":"ana","en":"But the website has a photo of the phone.","vi":"Nhưng trang web có ảnh chiếc điện thoại mà.","ipa":["bʌt","ðə","ˈwɛbˌsaɪt","hæz","ə","ˈfoʊˌtoʊ","ʌv","ðə","foʊn"],"start":28.274,"end":30.584,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,28.274],[1,28.358],[2,28.48],[3,29.037],[4,29.268],[5,29.363],[6,29.784],[7,29.92],[8,30.043]]},{"speaker":"leo","en":"Anyone can put a photo on a website. It's an old trick.","vi":"Ai mà chẳng đưa được ảnh lên mạng. Chiêu cũ rồi.","ipa":["ˈɛniˌwʌn","kæn","pʊt","ə","ˈfoʊˌtoʊ","ɑn","ə","ˈwɛbˌsaɪt","ɪts","æn","oʊld","tɹɪk"],"start":31.374,"end":35.264,"gesture":"shrug","timing":[[0,31.374],[1,31.815],[2,32.018],[3,32.209],[4,32.29],[5,32.874],[6,33.051],[7,33.146],[8,34.242],[9,34.433],[10,34.541],[11,34.827]]},{"speaker":"leo","en":"If you type Mom's card number, they'll take all the money in her account.","vi":"Nếu em gõ số thẻ của mẹ, chúng sẽ lấy hết tiền trong tài khoản của mẹ.","ipa":["ɪf","ju","taɪp","mɑmz","kɑɹd","ˈnʌmbɚ","ðeɪl","teɪk","ɔl","ðə","ˈmʌni","ɪn","hɝ","əˈkaʊnt"],"start":35.804,"end":40.154,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,35.804],[1,35.877],[2,35.986],[3,36.312],[4,36.679],[5,37.005],[6,37.983],[7,38.214],[8,38.513],[9,38.744],[10,38.853],[11,39.287],[12,39.437],[13,39.641]]},{"speaker":"ana","en":"All the money? Oh no…","vi":"Hết tiền á? Ôi không…","ipa":["ɔl","ðə","ˈmʌni","oʊ","noʊ"],"start":40.944,"end":42.464,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,40.944],[1,41.049],[2,41.171],[3,42.094],[4,42.175]]},{"speaker":"leo","en":"Watch out for messages like this. Never click the link.","vi":"Hãy cảnh giác với những tin nhắn kiểu này. Đừng bao giờ bấm vào đường link.","ipa":["wɑtʃ","aʊt","fɔɹ","ˈmɛsədʒəz","laɪk","ðɪs","ˈnɛvɚ","klɪk","ðə","lɪŋk"],"start":43.254,"end":47.034,"expression":"neutral","timing":[[0,43.254],[1,43.552],[2,43.851],[3,44.041],[4,44.652],[5,44.924],[6,45.753],[7,46.106],[8,46.446],[9,46.582]]},{"speaker":"ana","en":"I clicked it already. Is that a problem?","vi":"Em bấm rồi. Như vậy có sao không ạ?","ipa":["aɪ","klɪkt","ɪt","ɔlˈɹɛdi","ɪz","ðæt","ə","ˈpɹɑbləm"],"start":47.824,"end":50.374,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,47.824],[1,47.824],[2,48.146],[3,48.268],[4,49.314],[5,49.437],[6,49.654],[7,49.749]]},{"speaker":"leo","en":"Close it now, delete the message, and let's tell Mom.","vi":"Đóng ngay đi, xoá tin nhắn, rồi mình kể với mẹ.","ipa":["kloʊz","ɪt","naʊ","dɪˈlit","ðə","ˈmɛsədʒ","ənd","lɛts","tɛl","mɑm"],"start":51.164,"end":54.184,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,51.164],[1,51.434],[2,51.543],[3,51.992],[4,52.413],[5,52.508],[6,53.106],[7,53.282],[8,53.527],[9,53.785]]},{"speaker":"ana","en":"OK. Thanks, Leo. That was close!","vi":"Vâng. Cảm ơn anh. Suýt nữa thì toi!","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","θæŋks","ˈlioʊ","ðæt","wɑz","kloʊs"],"start":54.974,"end":57.974,"expression":"shy","react":{"leo":"happy"},"timing":[[0,54.974],[1,55.747],[2,56.06],[3,56.929],[4,57.119],[5,57.337]]}],"words":[{"id":"message","en":"message","ipa":"ˈmɛsədʒ","vi":"tin nhắn; thông điệp; lời nhắn","level":0},{"id":"prize","en":"prize","ipa":"pɹaɪz","vi":"giải thưởng; phần thưởng; quý trọng","level":2},{"id":"trick","en":"trick","ipa":"tɹɪk","vi":"mẹo; trò lừa; trò ảo thuật","level":1},{"id":"account","en":"account","ipa":"əˈkaʊnt","vi":"tài khoản; lời kể; bản tường thuật","level":1},{"id":"careful","en":"careful","ipa":"ˈkɛɹfəl","vi":"cẩn thận; thận trọng","level":0},{"id":"click","en":"click","ipa":"klɪk","vi":"nhấp chuột; tiếng lách cách","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Cảnh báo và giải thích nguy hiểm","pattern":"Stop! · Don't…! · Be careful! · Watch out! · If you…, they'll…","explain":"Cảnh báo gấp dùng câu mệnh lệnh ngắn: \"Stop!\", \"Don't click!\", \"Be careful!\". Giải thích hậu quả bằng câu điều kiện loại 1: \"If you type your card number, they'll take the money.\"","keys":["stop","don't","be careful","watch out","if you"],"lines":[3,5,11,13]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-the-fake-message.mp3","v":"36232c4aaa","duration":59.064,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}